{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>---STORY---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Chano</strong>, a human who dreams of becoming a being feared by all.<br>And as <strong>Turleon</strong>, a scalesaurus who will do anything to protect the innocent, even if the world fears him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When their paths cross, Chano will stop at nothing to prove he's stronger than that so-called &quot;hero monster,&quot; while Turleon fights to stop his madness and save those around him.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As Chano: destroy, defeat police and heroes, and execute your master plan.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As Turleon: rescue civilians, fight hordes of enemies, and protect the city.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your actions may change the fate of both characters.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>---GAMEPLAY---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turleon is a beat 'em up with platforming sections. Explore different levels, face powerful bosses, and test your skills as you decide what kind of monster... or hero, you want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">______</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you so much for your support while I work to deliver the best possible experience! c:</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087670?t=1761363219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087670/5b81d2808fef47c923866701218bdb0a509c654a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761363219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087670/a288785d16799448cd643a235a29788ba7ab0e73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761363219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a